<text x="64.77" y="35.052" size="1.778" layer="98">VDD/2</text>
<text x="86.36" y="27.94" size="1.778" layer="98"> I/U converter OPAMP is working to get I_cell == I_Rf
 - V_cell/R_cell = V_adc/Rf 
 - R_cell = V_cell * Rf / V_adc          
 - R_cell = 2*EC_SINE_AMP * Rf / V_adc    
 - R_cell = 1000 * EC_SINE_AMP / V_adc
 - S_cell = V_adc / 1000 * EC_SINE_AMP [S]
 - S_cell = V_adc / EC_SINE_AMP [mS]
</text>
<text x="93.98" y="20.32" size="1.778" layer="98">Vcell = 2*EC_SINE_AMP
Rf = 500R</text>
